  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/expandingtechnologies/minecraft_title.png\" alt=\"Expanding Technologies\"></p><h3>Expanding Technologies — это модификация, расширяющая мод Create новыми функциями!</h3><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/expandingtechnologies/create_vector.svg\" alt=\"create\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/architectury-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"architectury-api\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"fabric-api\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252findex_1.19.2.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"forge\"></a></p><hr><h3>Мод добавляет:</h3><ul>\n<li>Светофоры на железнодорожных переездах</li>\n<li><em>Если у вас есть предложение, пожалуйста, отправьте <a href=\"https://github.com/TeamDiopside/ExpandingTechnologies/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">форму с предложением</a></em></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252f8C3wTDdiaV4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/expandingtechnologies/videoplayer.png\" alt=\"Светофоры на железнодорожных переездах\"></a></p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fteamdiopside.nl%252fdiscord%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://teamdiopside.nl/assets/diopside/Serverbanner.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>",
